The trajectory of these peace accords proves that Indian federalism possesses immense elasticity. While European nation-states often fragmented when confronting assertive regional nationalism, the Indian democratic state converted armed militants into democratic Chief Ministers, institutionalising the eternal democratic truth that diversity and national unity are mutually reinforcing pillars of the Republic.

